      "body": "## Motivation\n\nThe `max_length` truncation behind `--log-requests` bounds the number of list items but not the size of each item, so a request with large strings (for example base64 `image_data`) can produce a multi-MB log record:\n\n- JSON format: the elided branch of `_transform_data_for_logging` returned the head/tail slices without transforming their elements, while the non-elided branch did.\n- Text format: `_dataclass_to_string_truncated` stringified list elements untouched in both branches.\n\nFixes #33164\n\n## Modifications\n\nTransform the list elements in both branches. Lists of plain numbers (token ids) keep the previous `str()` output, and strings, dicts and dataclasses inside lists are rendered as before when they are short.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable, logging only.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable. Numeric lists take the same `str()` path as before.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n\nVerified on a CPU-only machine (no server launched): the new tests in `test/registered/unit/utils/test_request_logger_truncation.py` fail on main (3 of 4) and pass with this change; `pre-commit run --files` on the two changed files passes; `test_serving_decisions.py` and `test_tokenizer_manager_rid_cleanup.py` still pass.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39016965525](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39016965525)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39016965452](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39016965452)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39016965455](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39016965455)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
